# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/GilwernPassage.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Gilwern Passage, Old Illtydian's Chamber, Morgannwg Passage
# (formerly known as Crystal Passage, Pretty Passage).
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on 15th/16th October 1994 by Pete Bolt & friends.
# Recording:
# Tape:
# Compass:
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey gilwern

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

